  "Psychosocial outcomes of an electronic self-report assessment and self-care intervention for patients with cancer:   
  a randomized controlled trial", "abstract": "BACKGROUND The use of Web-based technology to facilitate self-care and   
  communication with health care providers has the potential to improve psychosocial outcomes for patients undergoing   
