  support from a nurse case manager. OBJECTIVE The aim of this study was to compare the impact of access to a           
  Web-based asthma self-management patient portal linked to "}, {"study_index": 176, "title": "Screening for distress   
  in lung and breast cancer outpatients: a randomized controlled trial", "abstract": "PURPOSE Distress has been         
